  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Let the points of tangency lie on \\(AB\\), \\(BC\\), and \\(CA\\), respectively. By equality of tangent lengths, \\(BE=(AB+BC-CA)/2=(7+8-9)/2=3\\).",
